      "value": "<p>You call on Ormazd to scour the battlefield of heretics, and a rapidly swirling wind of flaming sand bursts forth around you. Every non-believer of Ormazd within your radius receives 1 @Condition[Ablaze] and @Condition[Blinded] Condition and takes 1 Damage, ignoring armor and Toughness, at the end of each turn so long as they remain in the sand swarm. For every +2 SL, they receive +1 additional Damage at the end of each turn.</p>"
